# Read-only reachability after seed + first reopen; no lifecycle actions.
wait
show-mere
wait
assert snap mere-live-sessions == 4
assert snap mere-archives == 1
assert snap sessions == 1
assert snap readings == 3
assert snap reflections == 1
remember compact-baseline
resize 420 760
wait
reveal mere-control fork
settle 2
assert visible mere-control fork
assert event visible mere-control fork
capture compact-reachable-fork
reveal mere-control trash
settle 2
assert visible mere-control trash
assert event visible mere-control trash
capture compact-reachable-trash
reveal mere-control save-archive
settle 2
assert visible mere-control save-archive
assert event visible mere-control save-archive
capture compact-reachable-save
reveal mere-control open-archive
settle 2
assert visible mere-control open-archive
assert event visible mere-control open-archive
capture compact-reachable-archive-open
same compact-baseline mere-attached mere-live-sessions mere-archives sessions readings reflections session-id reading-id reflection-id
resize 1160 760
wait
settle 2
